  "name": "Italian Spaghetti Sauce",
  "subtitle": "A savory tomato sauce with mushrooms, basil, and red wine",
  "description": "Build a rich, chunky sauce by cooking aromatics and mushrooms before simmering tomatoes, herbs, wine, and seasonings until thickened.",
